+Set p_r=1 and xi_r=(r+1)^2/4324, with4324=sum(s^2,s=1,...,23).
+For EVERY triple T subset{0,...,24} of size3, construct the displayed corner
+using the fixed weights in Section1. The C++ checker verifies primality of
