+Every coordinate is nonzero and xi'_i p'_i=1. The Python checker derives this
+transformation independently for all25 centers and checks its actual
+controlled-permutation local contraction, not only its scalar rank.
+Hence each new complement is one ordinary rank-one call in the fixed basis.
+No simultaneous generic-middle condition remains for these complements.
+
+Each old rank24 center residual remains a paid transform of a copied stream.
+Its actual fixed ordered profile can split into several widths; it must not
+be replaced by a guessed generic width22 profile or deleted. Once the full
+original-envelope internal profile is certified, the exact copied update is
