+with all other actual block counts unchanged. No inference is made from the
+rank histogram to the individual fixed-basis block histogram.
+
+4. One common L23, rather than a basis per motif
+
+For each fixed physical first-axis source projector, GL23 conjugation is
+transitive on rank-one idempotents and can send it to the normalized witness
+p=1,xi=(r+1)^2/4324. For each fixed second-axis triple, the complete finite
+certificate proves every required prefix-minor function is nonzero on this
