+lines; its role is to prove each function is nonzero. Generic first-axis
+ordinary projectors and its newly added center complements likewise have
+nonzero ordinary-profile functions of L23. Auxiliary and local-transfer
+scales are generic first-axis nonzero coordinates multiplied by nonzero
+fixed-middle evaluations, or by already fixed second-axis matrices.
+
+There are finitely many physical occurrences. Clearing denominators and
+multiplying their nonzero conditions gives a nonzero polynomial on the
+irreducible GL23 family, so a single rational L23 exists satisfying all of
+them. The middle internal profiles are fixed certified matrices, not further
+generic conditions. Universal data zeros impose no conflicting specialization.
+Choose the address prime only after choosing this common rational basis,
+avoiding the finite denominator/minor exceptional set as inherited.
+
+5. Outstanding composition obligations
+
+The original-envelope h25 producer/profile and copied-center multiplicities
+must be verified from their actual transition multiset. Producer scalar
+correctness, matching, complete row volumes and scratch restoration remain
